    <string name="step_battery">2. Battery Optimization: Set Battery Saver to \"No Restrictions\".</string>
    <string name="step_recents">3. Lock in Recents: Open the \"Recent Apps\" screen, long-press the app card, and click the Lock icon 🔒.</string>
    <string name="step_popup">4. Permissions: Ensure \"Display pop-up windows while running in the background\" is enabled.</string>
    <string name="troubleshoot_footer">For device-specific instructions, please visit dontkillmyapp.com</string>
